# ⭐⭐⭐ INCIDENCE ONLY, AND THE OMISSION IS THE POINT. examples/diagramming/main.rs composes this and
#    nothing wider, so the emitter is STRUCTURALLY UNABLE to read a magnitude. The
#    incidence composes and the quantities do not, and a diagram carries incidence. An emitter
#    that could see a figure could render one, and a rendered figure in a notation with no unit
#    is the nonsense product that file already names `the_product_nobody_should_use`.
#
# ⛔ IT WAS NOT A DESIGN DECISION, IT WAS A TYPE ERROR. Reading the wider relation failed to
#   compile: sqlx has no mapping for `pm.absence_reason` and needs a feature for NUMERIC. The
#   schema refused to hand a magnitude to a program with no use for one, which is the DDL's typed
#   absences paying out in a second language.
-- composition/parts.sqlc projected to F alone, with Phi dropped; one call activity per part.
SELECT p.composition, p.composed_layer, p.part_notation, p.part_filing, p.part_layer,
       (p.part_filing = p.composition) AS is_local
FROM (
    :compose(composition/parts.sqlc)
) p
